<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>로봇 격투 부스 포인트 베팅 시스템</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center p-4">

    <div class="w-full max-w-2xl bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-6 mb-6">
        <header class="text-center mb-6">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-800">🤖 로봇 격투 포인트 베팅 & 상점</h1>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">축제 부스 실시간 승부 예측 및 자동 배팅봇 시스템</p>
        </header>

        <% if (!user) { %>
            <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6">
                <h2 class="text-md font-bold text-blue-900 mb-2">💡 이용 안내</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-blue-700 leading-relaxed">
                    • 처음 방문하셨다면 사용할 <b>이름과 비밀번호</b>를 입력하세요. 동일한 이름이 없으면 <b>자동으로 새 계정이 생성</b>되며 기본 포인트가 지급됩니다!<br>
                    • 관리자 계정(ID: Admin)으로 로그인하면 경기 매칭, 포인트 관리 및 AI 배팅봇 제어가 가능합니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <form action="/login" method="POST" class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase mb-1">이름 (닉네임)</label>
                    <input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="예: 홍길동" class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 uppercase mb-1">비밀번호</label>
                    <input type="password" name="password" required placeholder="비밀번호 입력" class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl transition shadow-lg shadow-blue-200">로그인 / 회원가입</button>
            </form>

        <% } else if (user.role === 'admin') { %>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6 flex justify-between items-center">
                <div>
                    <span class="bg-red-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">ADMIN MODE</span>
                    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-1">관리자 제어 패널</h2>
                </div>
                <a href="/" class="text-xs bg-white text-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border font-semibold hover:bg-slate-100">로그아웃</a>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-100 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-700 text-sm mb-3">⚙️ 시스템 기본 수치 및 상점 설정</h3>
                <form action="/admin/update-settings" method="POST" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600">신규 가입 기본 포인트</label>
                        <input type="number" name="initial_points" value="<%= settings.initial_points %>" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600">컬링 게임 보상 (+포인트)</label>
                        <input type="number" name="curling_reward" value="<%= settings.curling_reward %>" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600">배팅 최종 배율 (@)</label>
                        <input type="number" step="0.1" name="final_multiplier" value="<%= settings.final_multiplier %>" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600">승리 시 보상 배율</label>
                        <input type="number" step="0.1" name="win_multiplier" value="<%= settings.win_multiplier %>" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600">패배 시 보상 배율</label>
                        <input type="number" step="0.1" name="lose_multiplier" value="<%= settings.lose_multiplier %>" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600">무승부 시 보상 배율</label>
                        <input type="number" step="0.1" name="draw_multiplier" value="<%= settings.draw_multiplier %>" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-span-2">
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-600">상품 구매 승인 비밀번호</label>
                        <input type="text" name="store_password" value="<%= settings.store_password %>" class="w-full px-3 py-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-span-2">
                        <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white text-xs font-bold py-2.5 rounded-lg transition">설정 저장 적용</button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-cyan-50 border border-cyan-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-cyan-900 text-sm mb-3">🤖 AI 배팅봇 관리 및 추가</h3>
                <form action="/admin/add-bot" method="POST" class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mb-4 bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-cyan-100">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1">봇 이름 (ID)</label>
                        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="예: 봇_알파" required class="w-full p-2 border rounded-lg text-xs">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1">초기 자산(포인트)</label>
                        <input type="number" name="points" placeholder="예: 5000" required class="w-full p-2 border rounded-lg text-xs">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1">배팅 성향</label>
                        <select name="tendency" class="w-full p-2 border rounded-lg text-xs bg-white" required>
                            <option value="player1">플레이어 1 전용</option>
                            <option value="player2">플레이어 2 전용</option>
                            <option value="random">확률 (50% 랜덤)</option>
                            <option value="underdog">역배 (적은 쪽)</option>
                            <option value="favorite">정배 (많은 쪽)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-span-3">
                        <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-cyan-600 text-white font-bold py-2 rounded-lg text-xs">새 배팅봇 추가</button>
                    </div>
                </form>

                <div class="space-y-2 max-h-48 overflow-y-auto">
                    <% if (bots.length === 0) { %>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 text-center py-2">등록된 배팅봇이 없습니다.</p>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <% bots.forEach(bot => { %>
                            <form action="/admin/update-bot" method="POST" class="bg-white p-2.5 rounded-lg border flex items-center justify-between space-x-2 text-xs">
                                <input type="hidden" name="botId" value="<%= bot.id %>">
                                <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 w-24 truncate"><%= bot.name %></span>
                                <input type="number" name="points" value="<%= bot.points %>" class="w-20 p-1 border rounded" required title="포인트">
                                <select name="tendency" class="p-1 border rounded bg-white">
                                    <option value="player1" <%= bot.tendency === 'player1' ? 'selected' : '' %>>P1 전용</option>
                                    <option value="player2" <%= bot.tendency === 'player2' ? 'selected' : '' %>>P2 전용</option>
                                    <option value="random" <%= bot.tendency === 'random' ? 'selected' : '' %>>확률</option>
                                    <option value="underdog" <%= bot.tendency === 'underdog' ? 'selected' : '' %>>역배</option>
                                    <option value="favorite" <%= bot.tendency === 'favorite' ? 'selected' : '' %>>정배</option>
                                </select>
                                <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded">수정</button>
                                <button type="submit" formaction="/admin/delete-bot" class="bg-red-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded" onclick="return confirm('이 배팅봇을 삭제하시겠습니까?');">삭제</button>
                            </form>
                        <% }) %>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-900 text-sm mb-3">🛍️ 부스 상품 관리</h3>
                <form action="/admin/add-product" method="POST" class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mb-4 bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-100">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1">상품 이름</label>
                        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="상품명" required class="w-full p-2 border rounded-lg text-xs">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1">가격</label>
                        <input type="number" name="price" placeholder="가격" required class="w-full p-2 border rounded-lg text-xs">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-600 mb-1">재고</label>
                        <input type="number" name="stock" placeholder="재고" required class="w-full p-2 border rounded-lg text-xs">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-span-3">
                        <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold py-2 rounded-lg text-xs">새 상품 등록</button>
                    </div>
                </form>
                <div class="space-y-2 max-h-40 overflow-y-auto">
                    <% products.forEach(p => { %>
                        <form action="/admin/update-product" method="POST" class="bg-white p-2 rounded-lg border flex items-center justify-between space-x-2 text-xs">
                            <input type="hidden" name="productId" value="<%= p.id %>">
                            <input type="text" name="name" value="<%= p.name %>" class="flex-1 p-1 border rounded font-bold" required>
                            <input type="number" name="price" value="<%= p.price %>" class="w-16 p-1 border rounded" required>
                            <input type="number" name="stock" value="<%= p.stock %>" class="w-14 p-1 border rounded" required>
                            <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded">수정</button>
                            <button type="submit" formaction="/admin/delete-product" class="bg-red-500 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded" onclick="return confirm('삭제하시겠습니까?');">삭제</button>
                        </form>
                    <% }) %>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-indigo-900 text-sm mb-3">⚔️ 로봇 결투 매칭 및 배팅 통제</h3>
                
                <% if (match.status === 'CLOSED' || match.status === 'FINISHED') { %>
                    <form action="/admin/start-match" method="POST" class="space-y-3">
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-1">플레이어 1</label>
                                <select name="player1_id" required class="w-full p-2.5 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                                    <option value="">선택하세요</option>
                                    <% users.forEach(u => { %>
                                        <option value="<%= u.id %>"><%= u.name %> (<%= u.points %>P)</option>
                                    <% }) %>
                                </select>
                                <input type="number" name="p1_fee" value="1000" placeholder="참가비" class="w-full mt-2 p-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white" required>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-1">플레이어 2</label>
                                <select name="player2_id" required class="w-full p-2.5 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white">
                                    <option value="">선택하세요</option>
                                    <% users.forEach(u => { %>
                                        <option value="<%= u.id %>"><%= u.name %> (<%= u.points %>P)</option>
                                    <% }) %>
                                </select>
                                <input type="number" name="p2_fee" value="1000" placeholder="참가비" class="w-full mt-2 p-2 border rounded-lg text-sm bg-white" required>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl text-sm transition shadow-md">경기 시작 및 배팅 오픈 (AI봇 자동 참여)</button>
                    </form>
                <% } else if (match.status === 'BETTING') { %>
                    <div class="text-center space-y-3">
                        <p class="text-xs text-indigo-800 font-bold">현재 베팅 진행 중 (P1: <%= match.p1 ? match.p1.name : '' %> vs P2: <%= match.p2 ? match.p2.name : '' %>)</p>
                        <form action="/admin/close-betting" method="POST">
                            <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-amber-600 text-white text-xs font-bold py-3 rounded-xl">배팅 마감하기 (역배/정배 봇 참여)</button>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                <% } else if (match.status === 'CLOSED_BETTING') { %>
                    <div class="text-center space-y-3">
                        <form action="/admin/end-match" method="POST" class="space-y-2">
                            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">경기 결과 판정 및 최종 정산</p>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                                <button type="submit" name="winner" value="1" class="bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold py-2.5 rounded-lg">P1 승리</button>
                                <button type="submit" name="winner" value="0" class="bg-slate-600 text-white text-xs font-bold py-2.5 rounded-lg">무승부</button>
                                <button type="submit" name="winner" value="2" class="bg-purple-600 text-white text-xs font-bold py-2.5 rounded-lg">P2 승리</button>
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                <% } %>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-100 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-700 text-sm mb-3">📜 관리자용 역대 경기 결과 이력</h3>
                <div class="max-h-48 overflow-y-auto space-y-2 text-xs">
                    <% if (matchHistories.length === 0) { %>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-center py-2">아직 완료된 경기 기록이 없습니다.</p>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <% matchHistories.forEach(mh => { %>
                            <div class="bg-white p-2.5 rounded-lg border flex justify-between items-center">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="font-bold text-slate-800"><%= mh.player1_name %> vs <%= mh.player2_name %></p>
                                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400"><%= mh.ended_at %></p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-right">
                                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-bold rounded">승자: <%= mh.winner %></span>
                                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">총 베팅액: <%= mh.total_pool %>P</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        <% }) %>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-700 text-sm">👥 고객 계정 관리 및 정렬</h3>
                    <div class="flex space-x-1 text-xs">
                        <a href="/?admin=1&sort=name" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border font-semibold <%= sort === 'name' ? 'bg-blue-600 text-white' : 'bg-white text-slate-600' %>">이름순</a>
                        <a href="/?admin=1&sort=points" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border font-semibold <%= sort === 'points' ? 'bg-blue-600 text-white' : 'bg-white text-slate-600' %>">포인트순</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="max-h-60 overflow-y-auto space-y-2">
                    <% users.forEach(u => { %>
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border space-y-2">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm"><%= u.name %> <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">(비번: <%= u.password %>)</span></p>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">포인트: <span class="font-bold text-blue-600"><%= u.points %></span> P</p>
                                </div>
                                <form action="/admin/update-points" method="POST" class="flex space-x-1">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="userId" value="<%= u.id %>">
                                    <input type="number" name="points" value="<%= u.points %>" class="w-16 px-2 py-1 border rounded text-xs bg-white">
                                    <button type="submit" class="bg-slate-700 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs">수정</button>
                                </form>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pt-2 border-t flex justify-between items-center">
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-amber-700 font-semibold">컬링 보상: +<%= settings.curling_reward %>P</span>
                                <form action="/admin/add-curling-reward" method="POST">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="userId" value="<%= u.id %>">
                                    <button type="submit" class="bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs transition shadow-sm">컬링 보상 지급</button>
                                </form>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    <% }) %>
                </div>
            </div>

        <% } else { %>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded-2xl p-5 mb-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase">환영합니다</p>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-800"><%= user.name %> 님</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-right">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">현재 잔액</span>
                        <span class="text-2xl font-black text-blue-600"><%= user.points %> P</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center pt-3 border-t text-xs">
                    <span class="text-slate-500">아이디: <%= user.name %> / 비밀번호: <%= user.password %></span>
                    <a href="/" class="text-red-500 font-semibold hover:underline">로그아웃</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-emerald-200 mb-6">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-900 text-sm mb-3">🛍️ 부스 상품 상점</h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3">
                    <% if (products.length === 0) { %>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 text-center py-4">등록된 상품이 없습니다.</p>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <% products.forEach(p => { %>
                            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border flex justify-between items-center shadow-sm">
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm"><%= p.name %></h4>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-bold mt-0.5"><%= p.price %> P</p>
                                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">남은 재고: <span class="font-semibold text-slate-600"><%= p.stock %>개</span></p>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <% if (p.stock <= 0) { %>
                                        <button disabled class="bg-slate-300 text-slate-600 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold cursor-not-allowed">품절</button>
                                    <% } else if (user.points < p.price) { %>
                                        <button onclick="alert('보유 포인트가 부족하여 구매할 수 없습니다.');" class="bg-slate-200 text-slate-500 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold">포인트 부족</button>
                                    <% } else { %>
                                        <button onclick="openBuyModal('<%= p.id %>', '<%= p.name %>', '<%= p.price %>', '<%= p.stock %>')" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition shadow">상품 구매</button>
                                    <% } %>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        <% }) %>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-100 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-200 mb-6">
                <div class="text-center mb-4">
                    <span class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full 
                        <%= match.status === 'BETTING' ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 animate-pulse' : (match.status === 'CLOSED_BETTING' ? 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800' : 'bg-slate-200 text-slate-600') %>">
                        <%= match.status === 'BETTING' ? '🔥 실시간 베팅 진행 중!' : (match.status === 'CLOSED_BETTING' ? '🔒 베팅 마감됨 (경기 진행 중)' : '⏳ 경기 대기 및 휴식 중') %>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <% if (match.status === 'BETTING' || match.status === 'CLOSED_BETTING') { %>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">PLAYER 1</span>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-2"><%= match.p1 ? match.p1.name : '' %></h3>
                                <p class="text-xs text-emerald-600 font-bold mt-1">총 배팅액: <%= pool.p1 %>P</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t text-[11px] text-slate-600 max-h-28 overflow-y-auto space-y-1">
                                <p class="font-bold text-slate-400 mb-1">배팅 참여 내역:</p>
                                <% if (pool.p1Bets.length === 0) { %>
                                    <p class="text-slate-400 italic">아직 내역이 없습니다.</p>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <% pool.p1Bets.forEach(b => { %>
                                        <div class="flex justify-between bg-slate-50 px-2 py-1 rounded border">
                                            <span class="truncate font-medium <%= b.is_bot ? 'text-cyan-700 font-bold' : '' %>">
                                                <%= b.name %> <%= b.is_bot ? '(🤖봇)' : '' %>
                                            </span>
                                            <span class="font-bold text-blue-600"><%= b.amount %>P</span>
                                        </div>
                                    <% }) %>
                                <% } %>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">PLAYER 2</span>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-2"><%= match.p2 ? match.p2.name : '' %></h3>
                                <p class="text-xs text-emerald-600 font-bold mt-1">총 배팅액: <%= pool.p2 %>P</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t text-[11px] text-slate-600 max-h-28 overflow-y-auto space-y-1">
                                <p class="font-bold text-slate-400 mb-1">배팅 참여 내역:</p>
                                <% if (pool.p2Bets.length === 0) { %>
                                    <p class="text-slate-400 italic">아직 내역이 없습니다.</p>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <% pool.p2Bets.forEach(b => { %>
                                        <div class="flex justify-between bg-slate-50 px-2 py-1 rounded border">
                                            <span class="truncate font-medium <%= b.is_bot ? 'text-cyan-700 font-bold' : '' %>">
                                                <%= b.name %> <%= b.is_bot ? '(🤖봇)' : '' %>
                                            </span>
                                            <span class="font-bold text-purple-600"><%= b.amount %>P</span>
                                        </div>
                                    <% }) %>
                                <% } %>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <% if (match.status === 'BETTING') { %>
                        <% if (myBet) { %>
                            <div class="bg-emerald-50 border p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
                                <p class="text-xs text-emerald-800 font-bold">✅ 베팅 완료되었습니다!</p>
                                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-1">
                                    <b><%= myBet.chosen_player === 1 ? (match.p1 ? match.p1.name : '') : (match.p2 ? match.p2.name : '') %></b> 선수에게 <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold"><%= myBet.amount %>P</span> 베팅함.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <form action="/user/place-bet" method="POST" class="space-y-3 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border shadow-sm">
                                <input type="hidden" name="userId" value="<%= user.id %>">
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                                    <label class="border p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-50">
                                        <input type="radio" name="chosenPlayer" value="1" required class="text-blue-600">
                                        <span class="font-bold text-sm"><%= match.p1 ? match.p1.name : '' %></span>
                                    </label>
                                    <label class="border p-3 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-50">
                                        <input type="radio" name="chosenPlayer" value="2" required class="text-purple-600">
                                        <span class="font-bold text-sm"><%= match.p2 ? match.p2.name : '' %></span>
                                    </label>
                                </div>
                                <input type="number" name="amount" min="10" max="<%= user.points %>" required placeholder="베팅 포인트 입력" class="w-full p-3 border rounded-xl text-sm">
                                <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl text-sm shadow">베팅 확정하기</button>
                            </form>
                        <% } %>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <div class="text-center py-4 bg-amber-50 rounded-xl border text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold">
                            🔒 배팅이 마감되었습니다. 경기를 관람해 주세요!
                        </div>
                    <% } %>

                <% } else { %>
                    <div class="text-center py-8 text-slate-400">
                        <p class="text-sm">현재 진행 중인 베팅 경기가 없습니다.</p>
                    </div>
                <% } %>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-blue-200">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-blue-900 text-sm mb-3">📊 나의 역대 베팅 참여 및 정산 기록</h3>
                <div class="max-h-48 overflow-y-auto space-y-2 text-xs">
                    <% if (myHistories.length === 0) { %>
                        <p class="text-slate-400 text-center py-2">아직 참여한 베팅 기록이 없습니다.</p>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <% myHistories.forEach(mh => { %>
                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border flex justify-between items-center shadow-sm">
                                <div>
                                    <p class="font-bold text-slate-800">선택한 선수: <span class="text-blue-600"><%= mh.chosen_player_name %></span></p>
                                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">베팅 금액: <%= mh.bet_amount %>P</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-right">
                                    <% if (mh.profit > 0) { %>
                                        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-bold rounded">획득: +<%= mh.profit %>P</span>
                                    <% } else if (mh.profit === 0) { %>
                                        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-bold rounded">원금 반환</span>
                                    <% } else { %>
                                        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-red-100 text-red-800 font-bold rounded">손실: <%= mh.bet_amount %>P</span>
                                    <% } %>
                                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">정산금: <%= mh.payout %>P</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        <% }) %>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>
        <% } %>
    </div>

    <div id="buyModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4 z-50">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-sm w-full p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-slate-800 text-center">상품 구매 관리자 승인</h3>
            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-xl border space-y-1 text-xs">
                <p><b>상품명:</b> <span id="modalProductName" class="text-blue-600 font-bold"></span></p>
                <p><b>가격:</b> <span id="modalProductPrice" class="text-emerald-600 font-bold"></span> P</p>
                <p><b>남은 재고:</b> <span id="modalProductStock" class="font-semibold"></span> 개</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed text-center">
                부스 운영자(관리자)에게 이 화면을 보여주시고, <b>관리자 승인 비밀번호</b>를 입력받으세요.
            </p>
            <form action="/user/buy-product" method="POST" class="space-y-3">
                <input type="hidden" name="userId" value="<%= user ? user.id : '' %>">
                <input type="hidden" id="modalProductId" name="productId">
                <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="상품 관리자 비밀번호 입력" required class="w-full p-3 border rounded-xl text-sm text-center focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeBuyModal()" class="w-full bg-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-300 text-slate-700 font-bold py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs transition">취소</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs transition shadow">최종 구매 확정</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const socket = io();
        socket.on('refreshData', () => { location.reload(); });
        socket.on('matchStarted', () => { location.reload(); });
        socket.on('matchEnded', (data) => {
            alert(data.winner === 0 ? '경기가 무승부로 종료되었습니다!' : `경기가 종료되었습니다! (승리: Player ${data.winner})`);
            location.reload();
        });

        function openBuyModal(id, name, price, stock) {
            document.getElementById('modalProductId').value = id;
            document.getElementById('modalProductName').innerText = name;
            document.getElementById('modalProductPrice').innerText = price;
            document.getElementById('modalProductStock').innerText = stock;
            document.getElementById('buyModal').classList.remove('hidden');
        }

        function closeBuyModal() {
            document.getElementById('buyModal').classList.add('hidden');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>